    "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/a/ae/Morrigan_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20241111125513\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Morrigan \" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"579\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Morrigan .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Morrigan_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/a/ae/Morrigan_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20241111125513\" /></a></span>\n</p><p><b>夜之女皇  </b>\n\n一位来自暗界树屋的美丽魅魔。她经常离开艾斯兰城堡，寻找能在家乡找到的刺激，去访问人类世界。实际上，她被称为「暗猎者」，这些是居住在暗界的夜间生物。\n\n</p>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"ae5b3b6150bca1bc44a1b909c7c56fd2\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Morrigan_Queen-s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:74px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Morrigan_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" title=\"Morrigan Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg (246 KB)\" style=\"height:185px; width:74px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/b/b7/Morrigan_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20241025031420\" title=\"Morrigan Queen&#039;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg (246 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Morrigan Queen&#039;